Good morning and happy new year. I'm requesting a plumber to my apartment.
The toilet runs intermittently and doesn't flush completely. My shower
water is yellow and smells like onion. All the drains including the kitchen
sink, washroom sink, and shower drain do not drain quickly and require the
blockage cleared.  I use a siege in each to prevent  accumulation of debris
as discussed last time with the plumber. Also, the shower temperature is
chaotic and changes from hot to cold and is out of control. Can you please
have the plumber come by to; fix the toilet running, clear the toilet
blockage, clear each drain blockage, investigate and if necessary replace
the shower head and the Thermostatic mixing valves.

 I have used various basic solution such as drank but I believe the drains
require a snake.

Anytime is fine. Please note that I do have a cat that loves to escape.

Thank you. Evan 585 Corydon ave suite 10

